# self_evident: Aquinas's reply separates self-evident in itself from self-evident to us, but this objection uses only the S2 sense, known as soon as the terms are known, through S8.
# exists_mentally: S7 says "it exists mentally" of what the understood word signifies, which is how A1 uses it, so I read one sense.
